16","arabic":"أَلَمْ نُهْلِكِ ٱلْأَوَّلِينَ","english":"Did We not destroy the former generations,","transliteration_html":"Alam nuhliki alawwaleen<b>a</b>","transliteration_text":"Alam nuhliki alawwaleena"},{"sura":77,"aya":17,"key":"77:17","arabic":"ثُمَّ نُتْبِعُهُمُ ٱلْـَٔاخِرِينَ","english":"[and] then made the latter ones follow them?","transliteration_html":"Thumma nutbiAAuhumu al<u>a</u>khireen<b>a</b>","transliteration_text":"Thumma nutbiAAuhumu alakhireena"},{"sura":77,"aya":18,"key":"77:18","arabic":"كَذَٰلِكَ نَفْعَلُ بِٱلْمُجْرِمِينَ","english":"That is how We deal with the guilty.","transliteration_html":"Ka<u>tha</u>lika nafAAalu bi<b>a</b>lmujrimeen<b>a</b>","transliteration_text":"Kathalika nafAAalu bialmujrimeena"},{"sura":77,"aya":19,"key":"77:19","arabic":"وَيْلٌۭ يَوْمَئِذٍۢ لِّلْمُكَذِّبِينَ","english":"Woe to the deniers on that day!","transliteration_html":"Waylun yawmai<u>th</u>in lilmuka<u>thth</u>ibeen<b>a</b>","transliteration_text":"Waylun yawmaithin lilmukaththibeena"},{"sura":77,"aya":20,"key":"77:20","arabic":"أَلَمْ نَخْلُقكُّم مِّن مَّآءٍۢ مَّهِينٍۢ","english":"Have We not created you from a base fluid,","transliteration_html":"Alam nakhluqkum min m<u>a</u>in maheen<b>in</b>","transliteration_text":"Alam nakhluqkum min main maheenin"},{"sura":77,"aya":21,"key":"77:21","arabic":"فَجَعَلْنَـٰهُ فِى قَرَارٍۢ مَّكِينٍ","english":"[and] then lodged it in a secure abode","transliteration_html":"FajaAAaln<u>a</u>hu fee qar<u>a</u>rin makeen<b>in</b>","transliteration_text":"FajaAAalnahu fee qararin makeenin"},{"sura":77,"aya":22,"key":"77:22","arabic":"إِلَىٰ قَدَرٍۢ مَّعْلُومٍۢ","english":"until a known span [of time]?","transliteration_html":"Il<u>a</u> qadarin maAAloom<b>in</b>","transliteration_text":"Ila qadarin maAAloomin"},{"sura":77,"aya":23,"key":"77:23","arabic":"فَقَدَرْنَا فَنِعْمَ ٱلْقَـٰدِرُونَ","english":"Then We determined; and how excellent determiners We are!","transliteration_html":"Faqadarn<u>a</u> faniAAma alq<u>a</u>